      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Yeah, good idea. The invite flag should stay on other players (it's linked to your world number) unless you changed to new world - then a new invite is needed.\n\nMany players want just swap for short time to other world because some another invites or to meet friends there, and then come back.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
    {
      "__v": 0,
      "_id": "5cd9e6be7be6271b5b109480",
      "author": {
        "_id": "5a68def40e6ffe41e7a21c33",
        "alias": "Elderberry Moth",
        "aliasID": "65c2a211ed6eefce4c61a72b",
        "anonymized": false,
        "avatarURL": "https://canny.io/images/8b13123eb0bdec3a142ffde874f3528f.png",
        "created": "2018-01-24T19:31:00.250Z",
        "name": "SarahVictoria",
        "serviceAccount": false,
        "urlName": null
      },
      "authorID": null,
      "boardID": "58c62efae9868f3662e9d9a1",
      "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
      "created": "2019-05-13T21:50:54.585Z",
      "deleted": false,
      "fileURLs": [],
      "files": [],
      "imageURLs": [],
      "integrationSourceType": null,
      "internal": false,
      "itemSourceType": null,
      "likeCount": 0,
      "mentionedUserIDs": null,
      "mentionedUsers": [],
      "mergeID": null,
      "parentID": null,
      "pinned": false,
      "postDeleted": false,
      "postID": "5c41be5dcc5f0a18d187b973",
      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This really needs to be a feature, especially with the issue of people getting dropped back to home-world at random. \n\nIt's really frustrating for the room owner to have to monitor for repeat accepts while at a party over the course of the night, when it's already at 25-30 people. \n\nIn addition, some people like to turn off their nameplates and UI to have a more immersive experience after the initial wave of invites/requests are done, which means they can't police the requests coming in all the time, and setting to Blue (Auto-Accept) means the room gets flooded during certain nights.\n\nIt would be a really good Quality of Life improvement for those at party nights.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
    {
      "__v": 0,
      "_id": "6580ea882bba409c2e610a2a",
